        "name": "Blank Slate",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your deceptions confound even the most powerful magic that could spy on you. Detection, revelation, and scrying effects pass right over you, your possessions, and your auras, detecting nothing unless the detecting effect has a counteract rank of 10 or higher. For example, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Magic] would still detect other magic in the area but not any magic on you, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truesight] wouldn't reveal you, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Locate] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Scrying] wouldn't find you, and so on.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 16
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Deception"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "rogue"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 16,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "cloud-step.json",
      "id": "r7FGPKl5e0xB4tuj",
      "name": "Cloud Step",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "r7FGPKl5e0xB4tuj",
        "folder": "P0uIuZsVDwcqYZnG",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Cloud Step",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Using fantastic acrobatic skill, you can walk for brief stretches across insubstantial surfaces. When you Stride, you can move across water, air, and solid surfaces that can hold only limited weight as if they were normal ground. If you Stride over a trap with a weight-sensitive pressure plate, you don't trigger it. At the end of your turn, you sink, fall, break fragile surfaces, or trigger traps as normal for your current location.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 16
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "legendary in Acrobatics"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "rogue"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 16,
      "category": "class"
