      "name": "Perfect Distraction",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "MjhCcwGKyI5dpNIY",
        "folder": "P0uIuZsVDwcqYZnG",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Perfect Distraction",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You use clever tactics to mislead your foes as you sneak away. You @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] while leaving a decoy behind. The decoy acts as the spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mislead], though you aren't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Invisible], just @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Undetected]. You can continue to concentrate to move your decoy, as with the spell, whether or not you remain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] throughout the duration. Once you use Perfect Distraction, you need to spend 10 minutes to set up another decoy before you can use it again.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 16
          },
